          "settings": {
            "title": "Fit & Fabric",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Premium 5-Panel Design</strong>: Sleek and structured, offering a modern fit that’s comfortable for any occasion.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Snapback Closure</strong>: Easily customizable for a secure and comfortable fit every time.</li><li><strong>100% Cotton Fabric</strong>: Soft and breathable, providing a high-quality feel that’s comfortable all day.</li><li><strong>Unisex</strong>: Designed to look great on everyone, adding a versatile edge to any outfit.</li><li><strong>Effortless Comfort and Quality</strong>: Crafted with attention to detail for feel and fit.</li></ul>",
